        "raw": "<p>We have a houserule that targets that have some sort of retaliation won&#39;t hit themselves with it.&nbsp; Gauntlets of Perdition will still activate, but Backlash Field, Flame Barrier, Combat Stance, the Chairman, etc. don&#39;t.</p><p>Not strictly official, but it makes a lot more sense than Wraith punching herself in the gut every round because she&#39;s got the Sewer Flu.</p>",
